# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

app-example

# generated native folders
# iOS stays untracked — D1 settled FCM/Android-only for v1 (#76:113-116), so no ios/ is ever
# generated here. Android is DELIBERATELY TRACKED (#209): a native tweak silently wiped by the
# next `expo prebuild` is a worse failure than a noisy diff, so android/ is a reviewable artifact.
# Reproducibility comes from pinned versions (see docs/runbooks/mobile-android-build.md), not from
# regenerating the folder on every machine. Build outputs are excluded by android/.gitignore.
/ios
